{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9aa5fcdd-4a76-8ab0-8e81-4c75664e1999",
  "created_at": "2026-01-28T13:54:20-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Julio Castillo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:51:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:51:23-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon. My name is Julio Castillo. I'm calling about genealogy records. I have a note here so I get the details right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:51:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, take your time. What are you looking for?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:51:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Birth records and a marriage record from the 1930s. They would be for my grandparents. I believe both events happened here in Newport."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:51:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Sorry, I'm hearing a kind of humming on your end. Are you driving?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:51:48-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I'm parked. There's a sort of pulsing sound, like an engine far off. It's a generator at a work site across the street. I'll turn up my volume. Can you hear me all right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:52:00-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I can hear you fine. It just comes and goes. So, records from the thirties. Do you have the names and approximate dates?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:52:09-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. The marriage was in 1934, I believe in the spring. The first birth was 1936. I have the full names written down. I can read them to you if you need them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:52:20-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not just yet. Records that old are often handled a little differently than recent ones. Generally, older vital records are open to genealogy requests. I would need to check how we handle the request, whether by mail or in person."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:52:34-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. Would I need to come in? I'm in the city, so that's possible. I'd also like to know about the fee. Is there a fee per copy, or a search fee?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:52:45-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is a fee, generally per certified copy. I don't want to read you the wrong amount, so let me pull up the current schedule. Can you hold for a minute?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:52:56-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I can hold."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:52:58-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Thanks for holding. I've got the page up. The fee is set per copy, and it can differ between a certified copy and a plain genealogical copy. The easiest thing is for you to come to the counter, and the staff there will tell you the exact amount when they find the record."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:53:16-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. So the fee depends on which type of copy I request. Let me write that down. Certified copy versus genealogical copy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:53:24-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. For a family history, you may only need the genealogical copy, but it depends on what you want to use it for."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:53:33-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's only for family research. And what are the counter hours? I'll try to come tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:53:39-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We're open weekdays during regular business hours, and the counter is on the first floor. Bring a photo ID and the names and dates you have. If you're not sure of a date, a year range is fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:53:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. I have the years and the full names with spellings. Is there anything else I should bring?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:53:59-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If you have any proof of the family connection, like a copy of a parent's certificate, bring it along. It isn't always required, but it can help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:54:08-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I have one of those. Thank you. That covers my questions. I appreciate your help, Owen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:54:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Castillo. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T13:54:18-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
